{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12145","headline":"县内水亭晨兴听讼 · 钱起","name":"县内水亭晨兴听讼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"晨光起宿露，池上判黎甿。\n借问秋泉色，何如拙宦情。\n磨铅辱利用，策蹇愁前程。\n昨夜明月满，中心如鹊惊。\n负恩时易失，多病绩难成。\n坐惜寒塘晚，霜风吹杜蘅。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"钱起","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_12145.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_12145","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}